<div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-original="true"><header class="text-right" data-ref="7b60d6f3-ea2f-418f-bf0d-3d5d2d83e413"> </header> <div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-original="true"><div id="lab-print" data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-original="true"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="b70c811c-ddcf-4050-8af7-909d64ca1880" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="b70c811c-ddcf-4050-8af7-909d64ca1880" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="1b819bdb-7c81-442d-95d4-e8756155c93e"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="7e96055a-d463-4d9a-868f-6fc390f91706"><thead data-ref="f9b8a8c9-52cf-4d70-af88-10d648cbf722"><tr data-ref="3ae08399-62a2-46f4-8d89-9d5641a2c1e0"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="bf13050f-d4ab-4fff-ab94-255ee3337bbb" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 1</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="4bd0f026-8f63-4099-987e-058609b80488" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="2e942cc9-1248-46e2-9dea-1aa0eba4199d"><i data-ref="92842f00-6da8-4f9e-b2ea-9cd43d263d77">Default Values of Primitive Datatypes using Static Keyword</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="90cc12aa-3823-4e1f-bbc3-82f9b317d792" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-07-27</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="e3210708-ae0d-4637-954f-8e40edcf916b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="6f30023b-6358-4291-969f-6c7e43a25272" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="ee8db63d-ca51-4973-860a-c88f34e49842"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="66a9ddac-c6f2-47ef-bfa4-a34196280b8c"><p data-ref="83b1afca-890b-4f8f-b00c-f8d5c481a4e2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program that demonstrates the default values of different data types.</p><p data-ref="86c87586-5aa8-4143-a48a-3a166e61828c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0ac425df-1a23-44b8-88cd-46890d78c467"></p><p data-ref="bc6ef457-7808-48b5-9c07-4e52f809f8f1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">When instance variables or static variables are declared without explicit initialization, Java automatically assigns default values.</p><p data-ref="8cd9d106-e8a6-4409-b79a-a5aa556ff001" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="3e8591f0-61c6-40de-9140-aa66f6a54246"></p><p data-ref="3cc39494-5181-4fd4-a460-2970d8ec2fb4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Your task is to:</p><ul data-ref="0f8e5800-dec3-4c9b-b011-2e301135a226" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="4a42e1b8-7d7c-43f9-adbc-94dcc81a6c3e">Declare static variables of the following primitive data types (<strong data-ref="5301ed0c-0531-4bf6-9ab9-d399036f2eb9">byte</strong>, <strong data-ref="ea81130a-7081-45a9-bf32-a1642bb15df5">short</strong>, <strong data-ref="d7468cd0-dd58-4ec3-ab2e-fc94e640afd1">int</strong>, <strong data-ref="3e593ce1-648c-435b-9d5a-076203cef6f1">long</strong>, <strong data-ref="3dab77c2-f518-464b-a34e-b979a66d2143">float</strong>, <strong data-ref="c724e57f-7ea2-480a-b271-f1652ceb76e8">double</strong>, <strong data-ref="80664848-6a20-48d8-ab31-1d51aa8d04e7">char</strong>, <strong data-ref="3c0e6494-efe1-4d81-9f82-a05b3b576cde">boolean</strong>) and one reference type (<strong data-ref="cac4e3b0-114a-47b4-9415-0742ff7c25f8">String</strong>) without assigning any values.</li><li data-ref="5b239a19-52fd-45ea-b31d-11dd2344f59b">Print the default values of these variables.</li></ul><p data-ref="441e65a4-527b-4131-b0e4-eba1fea009e9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-re