a-ref="5b232224-38cf-46df-a6e9-2276be5402c5" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="f2f8eafc-cf5a-4620-a766-adabd242ccfa"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="b0edad3a-f2d5-481b-b976-75627ae703d4"><p data-ref="20076a22-7d37-41b4-99ab-c1566ae5511b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a program to check whether a given element is present or not in a sorted array using the Binary Search technique.</p><p data-ref="75d8feda-fcd9-47d7-b503-c59f7c83392d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e601cf6e-a485-4afa-a7cc-d1375ac88929"></p><p data-ref="bc508af8-90c1-4839-bce9-8ba1f43d4f08" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="c7f7e905-b439-4536-9c91-e43cdf9779a8">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="9db9e832-505c-4497-96ed-eac7b70afc60" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="6ccb5678-3b75-43aa-97c7-b6df4f13e840">The first line of input contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="0aeaa6d7-54c6-4a77-9e48-28a1c0b22e25" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9e6883fa-6a39-4e57-be85-169febf1481f"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="23120cbc-f77e-43c5-875c-896d166a11d2"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="5a1b8cb1-e94d-41e1-af11-ab3d8b6d315c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="9a6eefc9-860a-4b43-b6f8-834a59b2db50"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="1923aa47-076a-44a1-abc9-1a2e895df0e8"><mi data-ref="d65b367f-f482-40ee-aef2-ed075dfe8519">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of elements in the array.</li><li data-ref="afb6f006-c45e-46a0-93fe-dd5bbd967327">The second line of input contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="9ff78f3a-46c8-4667-81be-4fc338cbd023" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="2feb144f-7fff-45ad-8634-bab17a4da641"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="fe825ac2-b03d-4581-85ab-b7855db93ed5"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="e2eb9b4f-decf-4f7b-b6cd-2a112017235f"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="726bd374-80f2-4dc7-bd57-77876d52d66d"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="a5487dc5-093a-4aeb-9e97-aaf749951e88"><mi data-ref="e5ece092-3d7b-4841-9bf8-d1a435c72bd3">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers representing the elements of the array.</li><li data-ref="a6d8c669-1c2a-44d1-8b74-d1390788b5a9">The last line of input contains an integer representing the element to be searched.</li></ul><p data-ref="77cfbff0-017b-4fec-a5e5-f237cc711238" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="a2eeb630-54bd-447f-a92c-9b12eb6edf43"></p><p data-ref="5e6ca66c-7a78-4bc0-a0a8-aeb03c051096" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="4d91f19d-309a-4420-82f2-4640141e569e">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="967ab17b-7e62-4cbc-b0cd-b2f31baf6500" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="3013ea66-8dc3-4970-b973-517c4e6db0ef">If the element is found, print the index.</li><li data-ref="3cd6b51b-f3bb-4797-b4c8-ddf55df28028">If the element is not found, print "Not found".</li></ul><p data-ref="0b1819cb-d4b4-4d0e-aed7-b84cd27d7122" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset=