ck;" data-ref="9b9e4b01-3f03-4c29-8c03-0ccd0f857a80" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="236745e3-5ac5-491d-aa81-4e2256373810"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="e09c3682-8ce9-4831-a6cb-047dec88a361"><p data-ref="579beabd-aabb-4fcf-a8f7-0fc1192394c7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to sort an array of integers using the bubble sort algorithm. The program should read the number of elements and the array elements from the user, then display the sorted array in ascending order.</p><p data-ref="3e20a5b0-d5c0-4ace-bbe2-99793070dd6f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="a277cbfa-157b-4105-8235-64cb0ecb1a8e"></p><p data-ref="df278bfb-582b-4ef0-91db-c5360838d0ea" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="4cc6a9d2-e663-4deb-804d-293f7bfad045">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="38118786-dd67-407c-8d8d-823b29c0533f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="d1c562eb-c775-4d7f-a368-01c3f63e331e">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="40ea8cf3-7bfa-445d-b952-aa0c91c8fafa" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9301874e-81c5-4860-8449-a66bacb4d91a"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="c16f3fd5-c59c-41bd-b830-6fa14c8bfaa1"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="7da28ca7-f9d9-4b4a-8844-bcdc20e96eaa"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="c429af49-3976-4481-b6de-5f03347d0242"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="68ab06ba-f830-4d37-aa34-e7aa297430cd"><mi data-ref="229a2097-a812-4986-8aca-62387a04669a">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> representing the number of elements in the array.</li><li data-ref="b7f0ed71-7277-4f1e-b52b-e0de3fa1bbd8">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="df68a07e-e956-4d06-b12b-25b2414b8e8c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1e13511f-38ad-4ea5-b699-164ad34c642a"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="435451a6-4c5d-42f2-b72b-2ddf25942f6e"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="e280b943-844a-4b12-ad29-b02258853bc0"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="13b39ee2-14e7-4cc5-b00a-48199017a0bc"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="8dc308f7-a0b8-4ab9-ab04-8c48e2d767cd"><mi data-ref="c3164440-25dc-42ad-a3fd-9206b4bd94f1">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers representing the array elements.</li></ul><p data-ref="79f6d61b-5cfe-4293-9333-cd36df8a6aef" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7f09925a-7f36-43c3-8bab-b928c35dfef3"></p><p data-ref="058b9374-e0e3-4f94-970d-23cf6e630088" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="af5e466e-55d8-419c-b600-b657a6efb105">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="902dfadf-e72d-4e88-8a89-ca68504ae343" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="7cbb20c5-b4e6-4500-b33a-b4c57080f4cc">Print the sorted array elements in ascending order, separated by a space:</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="4a8b28e3-d384-4fe5-bc1b-86b8fd43a5b7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">&lt;int1&gt; &lt;int2&gt; &lt;int3&gt; ...
