a-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="292cf7a8-a1d7-40bf-a092-914170d786a2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="dc15ede7-cbdf-47a7-84fc-94483c5e1a21"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="8942af10-bbd1-443b-99f8-91389aafd9c8"><p data-ref="c37478ee-8f1a-418e-87de-95dda297299e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">A group of friends sent a message to Jaya, but due to a technical glitch, the message contained duplicate characters. To overcome this kind of problem she decided to craft a Java program using a <strong data-ref="d3b41177-5d41-424f-a4bd-034845986ee4">StringBuffer</strong> constructor that takes the glitchy message as input and returns a new string with all duplicate characters removed.</p><p data-ref="0afdb9b8-b553-455e-a913-4093443812a9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d5b6881b-cdf6-48ae-99cf-d7f1cd4ee808"></p><p data-ref="cc0cf1cc-b97c-44b5-9c10-372f8b6a8d50" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">How can Jaya craft this program?</p><p data-ref="c0c57242-89ef-4b14-9570-77d31ed6e780" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="99d98f09-49cd-4761-8df1-135a591a33ff"></p><p data-ref="e7245612-15a9-42ef-8a20-7acb4cd606cc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="10eeaaf9-6bff-42c4-88b6-f785f0c24f71">Input Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="ebb6a862-75d8-46f0-ae38-3a12e7d8e4b0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The input line reads a string representing the glitchy message.</p><p data-ref="dced1902-eb1f-4652-a025-2d96182b466d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7f6be58d-457d-42b0-a6a1-946fe7f84bc6"></p><p data-ref="680fe2fd-12fd-4c7f-af7e-93405e5d2d8c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="23916b71-deaa-4319-8fbd-c7a1dac6dc1a">Output Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="d95ab775-f8b1-4de4-8c96-d293c3742179" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The output is a string after removing the duplicate characters (Including special characters, space).</p><p data-ref="f4109dc9-8774-43e1-9967-36510fb22d2c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d33f1621-6aec-4133-9305-bfa7978aef0c"></p><p data-ref="e3024878-c36b-4bab-932d-f53e8781d9ad" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="9921899d-7ac1-4f60-9387-d914eba96ae5">Note: </strong>Use println() to print the output statements.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="eeedf98b-2a95-4326-84c1-066a83efff9f" data-split-to="eeedf98b-2a95-4326-84c1-066a83efff9f" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="edb1eac0-fd8b-4ad6-b816-3cee194dc247"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="c532f572-c2a0-4dd7-a8ab-7eb6b6e0c20e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
