45ec166f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="4aef991f-82c6-4708-b55b-e9439df94ceb" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="49f21db0-d8e3-414a-893c-493cc27f7488"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="77ecc7ee-99f6-4673-8826-fba61a68e75e"><p data-ref="92244670-f5d8-4b59-8c5e-30139096ee9c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program with a class name OverloadArea with overload methods area(float) and area(float, float) to find area of square and rectangle.</p><p data-ref="0ca3c6a8-1b14-442d-be9a-66efd54c4ee5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="6816b165-cb72-426d-8f2c-e8dad98159d2"></p><p data-ref="29ae9a3f-9166-4774-bf75-578993e350a4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write the main method within the class and assume that it will receive a total of 2 command line arguments of type float.</p><p data-ref="c1f82b10-4a74-4898-bfbb-c43a6d03585e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c1e7cab5-f83a-4ac3-a750-86e0b6263748"></p><p data-ref="dd852fae-9a57-4e8e-8c07-5750072a9a0f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">If the main() is provided with arguments : 1.34, 1.98 then the program should print the output as:</p><p data-ref="88b2fc5a-b5ce-4bb6-8d98-b0f715b94230" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Area of square for side in meters 1.34 : 1.7956</p><p data-ref="b61579d2-cfcf-443a-9127-ced5a9806b3c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Area of rectangle for length and breadth in meters 1.34, 1.98 : 2.6532001</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="a40f5fa1-9cb9-41b3-990c-4f259af32dd2"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="8314fd4e-7d68-4da7-8aff-87a8e3da7c8d"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="af2f916a-bc55-4249-8751-a1d6afb8a499" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="e387564b-64a1-46ec-8846-a5f68d32031c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="d1bc796e-7f79-4160-adb1-cfb47e1984a4" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">OverloadArea.java</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="4d9b89a9-8ae3-4976-9ab2-21a83ac22c8f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">class OverloadArea
	{
		float area(float side)
		{
			return side*side;
		}
		float area(float length,float breadth)
		{
			return length*breadth;
		}
		public static void main(String args[])
		{
			float side=Float.parseFloat(args[0]);
			float length=Float.parseFloat(args[0]);
			float breadth=Float.parseFloat(args[1]);
			OverloadArea obj=new OverloadArea();
			float squareArea=obj.area(side);
			float rectangleArea=obj.area(length,breadth);
			System.out.printf("Area of square for side in meters %.2f: %.4f",side,squareArea);
			System.out.printf("\n");
			System.out.printf("Area of rectangle for length and breadth in meters %.2f, %.2f: %.7f",length,breadth,rectangleArea);
			System.out.printf("\n");
		}
	}</pre><br data-ref="5fa50afd-924a-466f-9a4e-bcb1f0e23dda"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
