				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-from="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c"><div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-from="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b"><div data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="ce856a5e-7838-4be9-8b3c-87018ae5c2d8" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="ce856a5e-7838-4be9-8b3c-87018ae5c2d8" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="6972a842-6efd-4701-a20d-e73b95755b50"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="e9057b60-0991-4258-84b6-a5ddbf02f004"><thead data-ref="3757fe12-3a17-4fff-ad27-6c821bf1af09"><tr data-ref="4f077fcc-04d4-4724-86ce-fc9b5ddb89ee"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="8ab328f1-ffd2-4c39-9c64-3feef7c687b8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 8</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="dee0da6a-ad29-480a-8645-83e685d8dc45" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="fda05ab2-e038-41b8-bc0c-dac34bc8221b"><i data-ref="397c6c3f-6356-4d0c-aac5-27c8831bae7d">Basics of Class and Object</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="f9eba2f6-9126-444b-9fdc-012c2318e7ad" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-08-17</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="70a72478-f692-4bd6-9b6e-8e7438a193de" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="38ecbfde-443c-4116-9a8b-a2057782bc0c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="c93c0aaa-3c87-48d3-8976-e31acdec9936"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="85255955-fa4c-40c0-98f5-79a38bdba131"><p data-ref="840b966d-fbc2-414c-ada5-ee509c304c8a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The Spy Academy is implementing a new system to manage information about their agents. As part of this system, they need to create a class to represent an agent. Imagine yourself as the chief developer, and your task is to design a basic class named <strong data-ref="ab60be5d-4aae-402f-9f66-a7c9ff9966dc">Agent</strong>.</p><p data-ref="28c266af-7c43-42be-a5cf-8a6556dab85c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="4b08384c-34a6-487a-8952-6b7b5ef8eaed"></p><p data-ref="1c1c9658-7f0a-4145-ad77-a339e54b6829" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="408f42d9-5e3d-4edd-856a-60abab286a16">Task:</strong></p><p data-ref="d21f0eb9-5f7e-4cb2-8712-0e1d33e5d40a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Design a class named <strong data-ref="9eabcc45-ba97-405a-a5e2-b4833b08493a">Agent</strong> with the following attributes:</p><ul data-ref="bd0b6674-c5e6-4278-acba-78aa86d7609b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="2a7d1ad0-60eb-454c-8658-d23ec71718b8"><strong data-ref="dcb606b7-d297-452b-9926-cdca00368d1e">name</strong> (String)</li><li data-ref="3c9a4030-3d0a-4de2-8fbb-9cd64c8a073a"><strong data-ref="30d0b37f-3460-4f8f-a837-2397b656901b">age</strong> (int)</li><li data-ref="6f76e7a9-e26b-4c11-bc50-31c1fcc5d80e"><strong data-ref="70e6fe37-122e-42d6-ac6c-0d70aaf3dad7">codename</strong> (String)</li><li data-ref="8bf236bb-4860-44b2-a929-f93702b345ee"><strong data-ref="5b62f18e-8049-40ec-ad58-939aed539c03">isUndercover</strong> (boolean)</li></ul><p data-ref="5c6eca34-0863-410e-b542-2e3c64b5efa3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Implement a method named <strong data-ref="a5bc654d-db9e-4b85-b1f4-a1b1a635aa4d">introduce()</strong> that prints a message introducing the agent, including their <strong data-ref="ec7a0e27-ece0-48fe-a2c2-47895324add5">name</strong>, <strong data-ref="c8a8692d-b8f5-4ee6-924c-5659efed91fd">age</strong>, and <strong data-ref="7a3ab7e2-8898-4d41-b320-755a00726854">codename</strong>.</p><p data-ref="60a4685d-8152-41f4-af4a-a19d214d100d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b05386cf-42d6-4125-b957-8d5a172d7590"></p><p data-ref="a9827c58-2708-43bd-829b-1871c404ea2a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="05c931b1-ebc3-421c-9bd0-75bfb0829c29">Additional Instructions:</strong></p><ul data-ref="24914eb2-1c8f-41fd-836a-9ff9fee97dd2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="00c59bfd-6d18-4766-8347-61b4f890f4c1">In the main method, create an instance of the <strong data-ref="ce13c312-4c20-4f7f-bab3-31792fcd941f">Agent</strong> class named <strong data-ref="ba5d9510-979f-45bc-a4b0-509436e6a243">topAgent</strong>.</li><li data-ref="e3941b7b-9c88-4dde-89f3-1c6606dca34d">Use user input within the main method to set the attributes of <strong data-ref="fa1ffee1-8420-4e88-9b99-a5dc7d6303b9">topAgent</strong> (<strong data-ref="3b6e9117-e781-44d7-b0b5-81a7531a050c">name</strong>, <strong data-ref="44736db2-4d9f-406f-bcc1-1aa6c5728021">age</strong>, <strong data-ref="855f30ac-77b4-4e40-b98e-ecf3ba863faf">codename</strong>, and <strong data-ref="4144a3e8-b65a-48ae-aeda-4f7327f613f3">isUndercover</strong>).</li><li data-ref="4c15e0d9-62cf-41b4-b6ae-2cf84a1f1f6e">Invoke the <strong data-ref="3d8e3f02-978a-49b7-8520-9eb4fb647bd3">introduce()</strong> method on <strong data-ref="4c527fda-9e5c-4328-9a14-a868c929480c">topAgent </strong>to introduce this top agent to the team.</li></ul><p data-ref="3784447b-4ecf-4801-b953-a5d141efd25c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="f9f5309a-b2c1-4d9c-8e9d-87ba14fb8e92"></p><p data-ref="ce9ce24d-9a8e-4043-a90a-a2be5e6389a4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a4f689e8-0ee3-446d-8811-7c070972ad63">Note:</strong></p><ul data-ref="cf8e527a-196f-4700-8124-0845f8788018" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="f62466af-8a34-4ac7-8850-9bbb46ec9e62">Partial code is 