ttom:1px solid black;" data-ref="a04437d4-f5da-4e03-9bce-b69ed08941d6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="811206cb-f20c-4b87-be97-b4ed4e07166c"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="3e375830-7cd6-4aa6-9e4c-ecb4602cabe4"><p data-ref="c244a2c8-c8af-4cb6-8b58-564ca6567b67" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to demonstrate <strong data-ref="0d687de3-0dd0-4335-8a36-23cb3b0e9f8b">single inheritance</strong> by reading an integer and displaying its square.</p><p data-ref="76bf6c9e-7143-4af8-9c20-a84949304972" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="70229012-a148-40fc-96a2-2bb8a6b1cfda"></p><p data-ref="981a7b20-a9f4-4af5-b5d6-86ab80e6b5d1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Create a class named <strong data-ref="5df768e3-796b-4693-9de2-c525c3a2d2fa">NumberIn</strong> with the following members:</p><ul data-ref="950c52a5-42df-460e-a071-50de988ecc29" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="2a74d3e7-8108-4e79-a4fa-9dd9c019e856">An integer data member <strong data-ref="6eb06ea4-22e9-41fc-ab10-478bf76e167a">num</strong>.</li><li data-ref="19adf171-e91d-4af4-bc1d-628408032af4">A method<strong data-ref="6c354a3d-289a-44e0-8c18-422905f8bb87"> inputNum()</strong> that reads an integer from the user and stores it in <strong data-ref="f910eaac-260b-45be-9a33-e3042d9ad808">num</strong>. The method should display the prompt:</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="9ba17df4-aab6-46ca-930c-9bb756bae8ee" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Enter number:
</pre><p data-ref="6e347eac-53ce-4dee-9aa6-576d1650fffc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e5f7f459-5d17-4bb6-bf79-f8cd6067888e"></p><p data-ref="a261f62f-2761-4bf2-8170-65e8ff6808c3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Create another class named <strong data-ref="91dd6ac5-9852-4b98-bb27-bdaef642cc7e">SquareOut</strong> that extends <strong data-ref="dc2da3c8-d1a5-4df5-95fb-1e18365e973b">NumberIn</strong> and implements the following member:</p><ul data-ref="f4fccf4a-19cc-4e4e-a323-8446bb85c428" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="d8fb68dd-0746-41be-8da1-26e35e3be8b7">A method <strong data-ref="49d9b4c0-e05a-4228-8dab-deb44614c481">displaySquare()</strong> that displays the square of the entered number.</li></ul><p data-ref="47307264-9f62-4834-b762-e369dcf619cf" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7ea8ecbc-e9d7-4e65-9275-be6348aeb5cf"></p><p data-ref="82d09651-09ca-46de-9635-bf804f3d84a0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="b5861aa7-0195-4bb5-a943-f4ba8154331c">Note: </strong>The <strong data-ref="7d795d84-cc29-47a3-a775-1dd9cb7cae4e">MainFunction</strong> class has already been provided in the editor. It creates an object of the <strong data-ref="b93a24e6-0279-499f-b781-7abb7120c76c">SquareOut</strong> class, invokes the <strong data-ref="4b577512-6bdc-4adc-9b67-3b8d0b8c8358">inputNum()</strong> method to read the input, and then invokes the <strong data-ref="642f2ba6-e5d9-46dc-b439-e62e97d80ce4">displaySquare()</strong> method to display the result. Do not modify the <strong data-ref="80e008de-649e-411f-946a-5fd1e1580c2d">MainFunction</strong> class. Implement only the <strong data-ref="a1321f56-5a8d-4896-b1ee-2b5cb0695297">NumberIn</strong> and <strong data-ref="227bd16e-4aff-4dbb-bc9a-ece3d870787c">SquareOut</strong> classes.</p><p data-ref="4b89d396-85c9-4997-917c-3d3b92374303" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e8effe75-afdd-48d2-9006-95e7ba2415ec"></p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="e9455f98-fa2d-4b1e-a94c-0d14a61329d5" data-split-to="e9455f98-fa2d-4b1e-a94c-0d14a6