2-40c3-a4e6-04267047b8f2" data-split-original="true"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="c0904ac8-c424-495e-8fc0-93f2bd097c29" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="c09bd7e3-84d6-4e55-830a-206a79e1c454"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="fccaf204-9352-4042-8339-69be9a72a5b1" data-split-to="fccaf204-9352-4042-8339-69be9a72a5b1" data-split-original="true"><p data-ref="39e7ca78-8430-4870-acf3-0399a0d1414e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program to show multilevel inheritance to manage student information and calculate their marks. The program should include the following functionalities:</p><p data-ref="e265ef80-d9bb-45e6-b5cd-fa63a93d29c8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="e09aa4cd-eea8-4518-898d-210a016218b0">Student Class:</strong></p><p data-ref="9ebc1ede-cd47-4863-b554-20d656b5f8ef" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should contain two attributes:</p><ul data-ref="c12513e2-6940-403f-86ff-3f3952657e10" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="7d63f15d-fb18-4c01-9aef-21a8d6b9457d"><strong data-ref="2fb2e67d-c72d-4d6e-91cb-add57e3da557">id (int)</strong>: Represents the student's ID.</li><li data-ref="f9b969d8-ea44-47f2-9c8d-3e71070d1b5d"><strong data-ref="91bbc69a-7cdd-41dc-8e0b-16c2b7f0eb78">name (String):</strong> Represents the student's name.</li></ul><p data-ref="7a7d7f0d-7ee4-413e-a782-4dd34e142f8b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="68117a72-b0c2-4406-b1f6-4a4702506ee2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="9722dbe9-04ab-45e5-9453-6a0775839337"><strong data-ref="87a8d8ec-8f04-4675-b512-5a1e4e7a0954">setData(int id, String name): </strong>To set the student's ID and name.</li><li data-ref="61bb0b67-775a-4446-89ba-fc5a0f811029"><strong data-ref="4ecf2e5c-bc06-401d-bc65-778183e2f94e">displayData():</strong> To display the student's ID and name.</li></ul><p data-ref="af66faef-888f-4aa0-9aca-1d0231e9b899" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="73c46941-d8f8-4ce6-a91b-5843240549af">Marks Class (inherits from Student):</strong></p><p data-ref="e8d56a48-6448-4537-a22b-6bce6af6bf11" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should contain the following marks:</p><ul data-ref="cc3934c7-a80b-4c01-9dcd-7cd43cc83c6a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="032bf46e-cadd-4024-b6b0-c1a89bcce27b"><strong data-ref="b88d6133-1d16-4386-884c-6a2d7fe750bf">javaMarks (float):</strong> Marks obtained in Java.</li><li data-ref="26241ae6-7be7-4085-b698-989e1348a815"><strong data-ref="5dfa77ad-c4cc-46bb-9905-8a4994f149aa">cMarks (float):</strong> Marks obtained in C.</li><li data-ref="2b8a8eb2-4e77-44ab-a9cb-76d45801fe14"><strong data-ref="d9434f82-1ee0-43a4-ad1a-658838405643">cppMarks (float):</strong> Marks obtained in C++.</li></ul><p data-ref="9363b6e0-ec8d-40ba-84ca-0fb3c630de8c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="78a1e146-8a5a-4833-b744-65359907a827" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="17b34315-682c-4e84-8649-06accc1530a3"><strong data-ref="3894bb32-633b-4fe0-b25d-21ada695823f">setMarks(float javaMarks, float cMarks, float cppMarks)</strong><strong class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="1ba85f40-aca1-44ed-aa6a-ae6f4d3c93b7">:</strong> To set the marks for Java, C, and C++.</li><li data-ref="35798d91-0e5c-4eae-9539-6b67aaa0ca61"><strong data-ref="dfa40832-4782-4745-8d27-9c95812d5565">displayMarks():</strong> To display the marks for Java, C, and C++.</li></ul><p data-ref="f48eff1a-db27-4833-8759-2d22fb15eb34" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a8099fde-1cff-459b-a8eb-1295f8de6945">Result Class (inherits from Marks):</strong></p><p data-ref="ad56a074-26b0-4fdb-b092-8ce392f98ec6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This class should calculate the total and average of the marks.</p><p data-ref="f0b222f7-e46a-4e04-a4fc-ddd69d0891ca" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Methods:</p><ul data-ref="35ed16d9-9b6e-4578-8b61-8920a0e81630" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="900eae20-ec84-45ee-8de0-6c35ffd5ba05"><strong data-ref="685e087a-8aeb-45af-a516-008f73159b74">compute()</strong><span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="50b19973-b5cb-4754-ae72-c3fcd500be0e">:</span> To calculate the total and average marks.</li><li data-ref="8ef67680-750d-4e6e-a9a8-7bcee7980715"><strong data-ref="60fe4796-331d-4bff-ae89-0f00cad917d7">showResult()</strong>: To display the total and average marks.</li></ul><p data-ref="b4dd7e59-b514-4bd6-a519-b632149d57e4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="9a5a9784-3a17-4e5a-85ba-1adece4258b1"></p><p data-ref="fbc8f1cc-35eb-448e-bfc4-e23ba85c744e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="808b32b1-cd77-4bbb-bc5f-4b28142db2b7">Input Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="9cb6b534-f950-4296-b7a4-3c3ce4fc9282" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The program should prompt the user for the following inputs:</p><ul data-ref="d70c03f3-dd81-4b60-a97a-9670bf09af13" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="b1e92133-0583-4695-a42b-8ba9b6019bfb">Student ID (integer)</li><li data-ref="d8cda0b0-dc69-455c-a97c-b2edcc97f72e">Student Name (string)</li><li data-ref="2e930e27-b57c-41e2-a4a7-eb8eaa3e2f58">Java Marks (float)</li><li data-ref="a7c3388f-34c7-465b-818a-e170368f359d">C Marks (float)</li><li data-ref="c63ed344-0403-4694-b962-cb09a22176bc">C++ Marks (float)</li></ul><p data-ref="01a87628-bf55-48cd-add3-75aa14cc0450" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="66faf5c7-9c61-44e9-b93e-cd4ac75d8789"></p><p data-ref="0f4e551a-fea2-41d7-a3e5-e98640c9a82d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d3da6e04-86da-4b65-b6d9-ba899cb1a8bd">Output Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="daccbd79-7650-4ad4-8850-2c5521e0089b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The program should output the following:</p><ul data-ref="1200caea-6c26-4e19-a8d5-0cfb7b2f4d31" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0" data-split-to="1200caea-6c26-4e19-a8d5-0cfb7b2f4d31" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><li data-ref="49442ea9-f708-4942-b04f-dff63e984280">Student ID in the format "Id : &lt;id&gt;"</li><li data-ref="c81ccd98-86fe-45b5-9c45-732b78558e46">Student Name in the format "Name : &lt;name&gt;"</li><li data-ref="1ee408c4-d477-4975-9b5f-de51189f9c66">Java Marks in the format "Java marks : &lt;java marks&gt;"</li><li data-ref="7857441c-5677-4ad7-b0bb-3cc8a649b411">C Marks in the format<strong data-ref="9ae99270-7e7d-4d39-981f-5c35e5caafc3"> "</strong>C marks : &lt;c marks&gt;"</li><li data-ref="f385ee5b-ab57-4b12-8852-17e6c766ad4a">C++ Marks in the format "Cpp marks : &lt;cpp marks&gt;"</li><li data-ref="85ae8037-9da9-4c0b-99b9-f95ba33f0123">Total Marks in the format "Total : &lt;total&gt;"</li></ul></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
