om:1px solid black;" data-ref="1339de99-cf59-469c-984d-5aaf3d0524db" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="8925f7f8-1fc8-40c5-b752-98b3f9082498"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="94c933eb-5325-48b2-9ef5-93e4d650cb8b"><p data-ref="8187c291-0343-4848-8553-230259c10e44" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Design an abstract class named <strong data-ref="afc16a24-bb69-4050-851d-62e0b68c7f47">Shape</strong> to represent geometric shapes. The <strong data-ref="3a3015e2-42ef-49a1-bdeb-0a657b7c53ca">Shape</strong> class should declare the following abstract methods:</p><ul data-ref="e3b0405a-93e8-4048-b0ed-efea738d4996" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="d1408267-5338-4d2f-8531-f0eb262775e1"><strong data-ref="8587091e-4ad9-49d8-a9b4-35689a649680">double calculateArea(</strong>): Calculates and returns the area of the shape.</li><li data-ref="1d635699-3378-42eb-bc9e-0f463ba0381e"><strong data-ref="6c85c9c8-b3ee-420b-9d01-868ad040ee94">double calculatePerimeter()</strong>: Calculates and returns the perimeter of the shape.</li></ul><p data-ref="0d677b99-aab6-4a58-aae1-5f0de3eac134" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In addition, implement a concrete method named <strong data-ref="4ccedb84-89c7-4641-9cc0-729159ada1d5">displayDetails()</strong> that displays the area and perimeter of the shape. Create a subclass named <strong data-ref="5ea7cce6-a40b-4c7c-9ab2-88ee6bb97aea">Circle</strong> that extends the <strong data-ref="b9f4ebd7-f4f6-44b8-b5af-23a5cfafd84c">Shape</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="b50608c8-7d9a-4aa7-bfd5-8390c5cb59dd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="f7960576-1de9-4704-866a-6d5799c109eb"></p><p data-ref="ac6fd942-6359-48c4-a380-7d7dcaee318a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="721a33b5-28c2-4b79-bee8-906556bb5421">Circle</strong> class should:</p><ul data-ref="03d66625-aef0-41ce-a5c7-aa04b26120b5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="2f65316f-d601-4097-a386-559e00512fa7">Store the radius of the circle.</li><li data-ref="6ddaf660-df80-4c3d-8e56-3d93d60e9d49">Implement the <strong data-ref="156445bd-a25e-4f19-892f-99a7e12323bf">calculateArea()</strong> method to calculate and return the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="edeba23a-f375-493e-ba4a-7cd02b5eb323">Implement the <strong data-ref="57c9f7d1-8baa-4de7-9e82-4cb6717d3c81">calculatePerimeter()</strong> method to calculate and return the perimeter (circumference) of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="e0473a1a-ece1-4d2b-a1c9-8cb0c3108f07" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5c52d120-55eb-4219-b608-0a6f4378b450"></p><p data-ref="03c5d16f-02d2-4a7f-8f87-8b52e2e4a245" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="57e2bb95-d061-4b9f-95a8-c43002430fd8">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="18994b18-928c-43b8-9a8f-763c843ea62f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="a042895c-beb0-43f3-8316-323728e71eba">The first line reads an integer representing the radius of the circle on the same line after the prompt:</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="c9f80914-b1a7-4e22-8881-ca4bf63171f0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Enter the radius of the circle: &lt;radius&gt;
</pre><p data-ref="a6c3617c-a807-4458-8129-a0c61f92374d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="ed928047-2b1e-496f-a0ce-c06dfbae439e"></p><p data-ref="caa30cb9-8205-4639-89e4-9d9c27284b3d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d6559603-bcca-4e9f-b05b-13be5c1e391d">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="198f2c99-f80a-49dc-ad66-da428620ff42" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c17544fd-3435-44c8-98c2-cefd0626de73">The output displays the details of the circle in the following format:</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="82ade732-aac8-451b-8937-174beedbd987" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Shape details:
Area: &lt;area&gt;
Perimeter: &lt;perimeter&gt;
</pre><p data-ref="efb9de64-baba-4862-961b-dae8828adcb2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="728d24c4-53cf-47f5-bb1d-692b2358ee67"></p><p data-ref="bb0e3f70-e82c-45cc-81d8-288be50a92c5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a0046901-fe4f-429f-b135-989b54034ad0">Note: </strong></p><ul data-ref="4d515608-afa0-4149-8e77-2a7028f7ef77" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="820a6347-b628-4df3-b948-01c12577e7cc">Use <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="b7be3605-908a-45c0-ba35-a7e71ea220b5">Math.PI</span> as the value of <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="30fdbcce-4680-4a78-bc57-5a7607b7339a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="b0740669-b700-4020-98fa-75958904247f"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="4c93cb09-2072-447b-a48e-1e22bac8b944"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D70B TEX-I" data-ref="fbb0edd9-7fef-4ed9-b64f-ed258b9b44e3"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="1207af77-964d-49de-b46e-99021ff93e7e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ada8456e-2294-4ed3-890d-d3201eb949dd"><mi data-ref="b2dafd02-a25c-420b-a40d-2b74e0efb80f">π</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> while calculating the area and perimeter of the circle.</li><li data-ref="4316f538-4c5f-446f-a23b-dca997a80ed4">A partial code is provided in the editor. Complete the given code by implementing the required logic.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="0b005736-e227-413f-aa22-b4167ac6de7b" data-split-to="0b005736-e227-413f-aa22-b4167ac6de7b" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="95dfb82d-d598-486b-8f54-c40b6c272379"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="effe32b3-af44-45de-bbcd-15f68e2aff02" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
