				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-from="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c"><div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-from="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b"><div data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="adf89f65-066d-4033-815b-064c2938abdd" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="adf89f65-066d-4033-815b-064c2938abdd" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="b774651b-dfe9-41c0-8cba-94381da15d03"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="0fad4e78-abed-4f0c-a2f6-e29e2dad2f16"><thead data-ref="5b703a32-bac8-460c-bb4d-22c026ec856e"><tr data-ref="a9549e0f-5569-476c-ad24-4b5ac1c0f80a"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="a8fa3fdf-8cde-4f57-a1d4-343b15009b1a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 14</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="a7949c82-db5e-43a8-9bf2-a684efc49da1" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="f57dbc9a-32eb-4cde-9e62-7a061eeea4b1"><i data-ref="e8fc79db-ffed-4dff-a25f-c6c62aff571b">Implementation of Multiple Inheritance using Interface</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="f0f4ef0d-c385-4be8-82aa-594fd4df8291" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-09-28</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="0c1921dc-98ba-4542-9a80-a9134693fbf7" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="4c1a47dd-4d89-480b-95b3-590884009f0c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="a1823fa4-8e6c-46f0-a312-3576d3ff2b0d"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="2be3915e-e8c2-4c66-8645-cae45abe68d6"><p data-ref="3d034a37-c273-42d6-8955-aaad0544ffb7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are required to implement the <strong data-ref="8dc8f8fb-1092-4370-ba4a-baa99a51a748">Circle</strong> class, which demonstrates multiple inheritance using interfaces. The provided <strong data-ref="bb4cd56e-e962-45d4-b3fa-df1b4666c8d9">Shape</strong> and <strong data-ref="0986432d-6780-418b-aa05-8108f128217e">Color</strong> interfaces define methods that need to be implemented within the <strong data-ref="4f6f4bcd-536f-45ec-8f32-c8e0d3b67caa">Circle</strong> class.</p><p data-ref="5294da33-c79a-4489-9303-99d0f8adcede" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="ff279edd-153d-4326-8e77-b8e539af59aa"></p><p data-ref="f592514e-81bf-4347-8be4-699ec87ce580" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. <strong data-ref="12a2b1a8-4101-4561-b9e1-9bb304e340f9">Shape</strong> Interface:</p><p data-ref="c42f6305-c00e-4ec9-8175-c219e8c99b05" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="e0be4e5e-497e-4305-9bba-b4fbe643bf0a">Shape</strong> Interface contains two methods:</p><ul data-ref="646991fd-49c2-46b6-8934-c5dd84e1df34" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="9defe0a5-785b-44b6-9c65-1a09eb897887"><strong data-ref="a2a5187d-418c-4433-8afd-b2337882a904">double calculateArea():</strong> To calculate the area of the circle.</li><li data-ref="2302bcc1-3029-43e7-b5af-1d74406baee3"><strong data-ref="1283c337-302b-4306-8e4f-9a00b232e0a7">double calculatePerimeter():</strong> To calculate the perimeter of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="7782def7-7531-4acc-b79b-ed96d403b452" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The <strong data-ref="5f780262-81f0-48d5-8f54-0ec1e582b925">Color</strong> Interface contains one method:</p><ul data-ref="f39fd69f-906b-4ea9-93fe-2900d9bb1f51" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="9a9bfc13-53df-4a2a-ad88-30c19110afcf"><strong data-ref="7f9cad76-94a9-43fe-8036-54615ef44dde">String getColor():</strong> To get the color of the circle.</li></ul><p data-ref="7f4e9c43-c18a-4c41-bb00-a3bf04088636" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="20d2c241-4a5e-44ac-9305-fb193b258a40"></p><p data-ref="dc097041-8f22-42ed-b4e2-c5572164e5cd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Circle <strong data-ref="ab229494-e0fd-4a0f-a501-c0bafb0de76b">Class</strong></p><ul data-ref="94401754-a733-4f18-81f6-5fafc6cb2de7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="40623043-ea69-4c3a-8b3c-be00646cde0a">Create a class named <strong data-ref="13b2b507-0455-446f-9d5e-1b7078e79216">Circle</strong> that implements both the <strong data-ref="beeeb32c-277c-4ad6-8d71-623cb50bd706">Shape</strong> and <strong data-ref="0e97c3b3-c771-4185-9be7-aa62495f2456">Color</strong> interfaces.</li><li data-ref="840bf70f-38bd-4903-9c12-10ee6c633cab">The class should contain:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="29f3b2a2-9d35-40e9-ad40-6a1c5bfcdc72">A double variable to store the radius of the circleA String variable to store the color of the circle</li><li data-ref="3fbf0294-3382-46ec-9745-7a7b6228b265">The class must provide method bodies for all methods declared in the interfaces.</li><li data-ref="50d211b3-5bd8-48af-94c4-b7bd5494d234">Implement the calculations using the following formulas:</li><li data-ref="99dae54d-1f8f-4a68-af42-ecaeccdcf58a"><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="4d98dcee-293a-407c-b837-bc67a1963c06" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="80c2cf1d-ff47-4292-a863-2be916fd2f5d"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="6007e321-ae3f-4756-aa1c-170263cfe126"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D434 TEX-I" data-ref="c5d79446-6b1e-4052-8046-8101e76d5fe6"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="b7947be4-7709-4540-8860-b32d5e7c3328"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45F TEX-I" data-ref="45a12c58-e4e6-46cb-94a9-a45a3965728f"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="b100c4e9-1104-4a74-8748-ba9ed545e296"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D452 TEX-I" data-ref="c4a3b064-909a-4b27-b32f-cfdb1a3fbe8e"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="ed87f808-7498-4dde-bb2d-593c9233aeb8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44E TEX-I" data-ref="eac48c1a-151b-41aa-b986-225dc67f6875"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class="mjx-n" space="4" data-ref="b394a257-d06e-43a4-a34b-2dcbe89fd3e9"><mjx-c class="mjx-c3D" data-ref="61747dfb-fc58-4bee-8d41-fee21d470c6b"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" space="4" data-ref="8e82a765-57a3-4637-aaa8-681803d4c9eb"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D70B TEX-I" data-ref="1a0e700a-f1f0-4c84-8db1-9a95a4187035