ArithmeticException</span>)</li><li data-ref="05ae706a-fd26-4c14-93b1-8f185fd3e456" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0" data-counter-list-num-increment="1" data-counter-increment="list-num" data-counter-list-num-value="5" data-item-num="2">Accessing an invalid index in an array (<span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="580f3205-ab10-4eb9-b6a0-be8ea6cd50d2">ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException</span>)</li><li data-ref="321956d6-8e02-452f-b292-07711d04072f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0" data-counter-list-num-increment="1" data-counter-increment="list-num" data-counter-list-num-value="6" data-item-num="3">Using a method on a null object (<span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="1abc7437-a13f-4f0e-bf54-f29be0f4a767">NullPointerException</span>)</li></ol><p data-ref="9ae89ea1-d816-47fd-8958-33f00dcb781c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="68910eb2-7eca-455c-b9ed-3a5bf5112f74"></p><p data-ref="0eb0bcf9-892d-40b7-955c-06f9fe706400" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The program should prompt the user for inputs in sequence, perform each operation, and handle exceptions using try-catch blocks, printing appropriate error messages or results.</p><p data-ref="31340161-f88e-49f0-a180-38642fda2b6c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0ca7fe0b-49f9-4e61-8f80-00b37629044c"></p><p data-ref="a96ac880-2a69-4061-b79f-1ed9c05bc74f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="3eb3f2d6-a0ad-490c-b024-376678dc0c81">Input and Output Format (in order of execution):</strong></p><p data-ref="0b749d5f-d526-4428-b868-450bf9469175" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="0339609b-0bfe-4c59-b78d-53e8bf0a3336">Division Operation:</strong></p><p data-ref="793d1945-1310-4514-aa55-470cf5865d1e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a4a338c6-e02c-4075-9812-977e6f2b92c9">Input:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a868fbee-cdbc-46fa-898b-a05ba14d379e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5d680738-934e-49c7-9c62-4baf2efb86b0">First line prompts "Enter the numerator: " followed by an integer input for the numerator.</li><li data-ref="6d8da807-ffbc-4411-9ab8-1380ec141438">The second line prompts "Enter the denominator: " followed by an integer input for the denominator.</li></ul><p data-ref="a336fb1b-2edf-437b-888c-3c2c06616a35" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="5c0dcf7a-998d-4155-a8c3-49ed118eadd6">Output:</strong></p><ul data-ref="d27611d0-f035-4c82-83f3-414bb7019e53" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="a18c7859-7a19-4458-9b80-610d991c4e4f">If the denominator is 0, print: "ArithmeticException: Division by zero is not allowed."</li><li data-ref="b1bb7b07-22bf-4aff-a68c-de2d90da6511">Otherwise, print: "Result of division: &lt;result&gt;"</li></ul><p data-ref="99c17e86-861f-4321-907f-4577a339724e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="ddbb9efb-4a3d-4a3b-b350-3f4cda97b00b">Note:</strong> Handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="30df6d4f-7722-4568-b803-89afd4aea052">ArithmeticException</span> for division by zero.</p><p data-ref="cb0f6435-69d6-4585-84c5-1561b4dc9760" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c08684df-3616-44a7-ac25-7ce00bd2123e"></p><p data-ref="76ba52d8-2640-40fa-a0fe-79d36aad521a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="8e11c715-1545-480b-9ef6-c16813a0cfcd">Array Access Operation:</strong></p><p data-ref="4d6e957d-abd2-41ee-90d0-ef3f1d1b3ea1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a435f74e-ee34-4129-993c-d7fc62059537">Input:</strong></p><ul data-ref="b0499c96-18df-42ce-bbf1-f6986d371940" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="07198eeb-194c-44a2-9ac6-d083743962f5">Third line prompts "Enter the index to access in the array: " followed by an integer input.</li><li data-ref="2afa1594-7317-4a19-9127-857d63ce65f8">Use a predefined array {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}.</li></ul><p data-ref="61b32810-c24e-4bce-a687-0702055562d0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="0225ef27-03a9-4b90-aa60-bbdb3d7593cd">Output:</strong></p><ul data-ref="9b4d1ef9-5a5e-44de-8f7b-79e36762931e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="94426398-53a3-4758-97a2-926d71ba4720">If the index is invalid, print: "ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: Index is out of bounds."</li><li data-ref="5c7f4d4a-9ba3-4caf-80d5-0d3ab13142a0">Otherwise, print: "Value at index &lt;index&gt;: &lt;value&gt;"</li></ul><p data-ref="39e66060-58a7-4c95-9ce5-dfa4ac467452" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="0c2f759d-e861-4e50-9670-e2e7ceb41aaa">Note:</strong> Handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="eef70d82-2797-4d81-ac32-10b5f8ff767a">ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException</span> for invalid indices.</p><p data-ref="6fe2cf11-ac58-43e8-9082-061818be5f5b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="3032f9a6-c99f-4b83-a4e1-02e07c5849fe"></p><p data-ref="20bcdb4a-4401-4857-a86b-161d2a419cdc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cc5ead83-cd45-4b4e-a34d-59a4cd27463d">String Length Operation:</strong></p><p data-ref="7b8cfdf2-6b70-4a70-a68a-07e9a17621aa" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="ae8fbe38-9f9a-46db-8d0b-0225377c8f30">Input:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a7bba557-8cdc-429c-9d53-ddf751af0909" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="8e16463e-1098-43e8-892b-5ec24061edb1">Fourth line prompts "Enter a string (or 'null' to simulate null pointer exception): " followed by a string input</li><li data-ref="92957739-09e7-4400-8f73-abadbf2bf763">If the input is the literal string "null", treat it as a null reference.</li></ul><p data-ref="2d182fb0-55de-49bf-9cf8-82b00e50b2d2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="80188479-39ac-4c72-9270-1c2995ae9dee">Output:</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
