e="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="44d5ba19-c8d3-444c-a8f4-631633e0f11f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="e8f9f08e-6c37-4107-b258-541d734b1ccb"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="2d271d50-b581-4a4c-ac5f-f301f21f8afe"><p data-ref="2f3c2619-037a-4a02-bf96-2b20bb9c46d9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java Program to illustrate <strong data-ref="ad980011-03f6-4567-8cc6-49ec30eb22eb">Multiple Catch</strong> blocks using command line argument. Refer to the sample test case provided to write the code.</p><p data-ref="7da67074-a013-46f7-87ab-58dc48e7fd87" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="1d93bbe6-f6be-413b-b8db-3390a39f845e"></p><p data-ref="d480be6a-be6d-4ce1-827d-56bfb1c5e584" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="c8256bc1-b7f2-4825-b09a-674b5b03b076">Input Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="b2b24893-6527-4270-8501-4d8cbc38c6c5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The program takes two command-line arguments:</p><ul data-ref="e6154b55-c348-4c3d-9edb-0d5da39130ca" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="cd873221-2695-4fae-96ec-817466da8189">The first argument is the numerator (an integer).</li><li data-ref="a57e8285-d56e-4892-888f-4611871d4422">The second argument is the denominator (an integer).</li></ul><p data-ref="4dbc635f-a478-4919-bc11-5e4ecb3cdeb4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="026beed6-9101-457f-b31d-696360015756"></p><p data-ref="501a04f4-9fde-43f2-a554-d0d00a254e2a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="6a3758c4-4d64-4db5-92be-b4a6457f5257">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="66235746-125f-43af-a6e9-d49aae185c1e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="986ec9da-c898-430d-8073-73b2b86abfb5">If both inputs are valid integers, print the result of the division in the format: "Division: result"</li><li data-ref="446ae7f0-5e7a-4fe4-97c8-9520cf237d9c">If the denominator is zero, print: "Cannot divide with zero"</li><li data-ref="0f4ce70e-75ca-4599-b5e3-2e8be322ddf9">If the inputs are not valid integers, print: "Input is not of integer type"</li><li data-ref="e7e88732-0969-4b5a-b93a-b3f135b16f12">If there are insufficient inputs, print: "Insufficient inputs"</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="c68e1a57-94d4-42d0-b9a6-4ea1e2e71a73" data-split-to="c68e1a57-94d4-42d0-b9a6-4ea1e2e71a73" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="59f88b0d-3ae1-45b9-ba4e-d262b9cff25b"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="254545a5-1968-440a-bd59-dcc5c1a731a8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
