ck;" data-ref="07099f26-4f47-48e0-b7a1-71f4fa0fa25e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="305993fd-c232-4e49-be55-492f0e3f199a"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="76d1c2b2-046e-462f-b313-84d00939f93b"><p data-ref="b1ecfc33-a9b7-45e2-bd85-482c1fee2af9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Divijoy is creating a calculator application that returns the cube root of the given number. He wants to write Java code for his application that handles multiple exceptions such as input other than a double or a negative number in a single catch block.</p><p data-ref="eb2c3204-1d9e-404d-9e44-855a22f3d0db" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0717a486-eecc-40ad-babb-1e129dbe4275"></p><p data-ref="35743af9-ffa9-455c-9d19-e2d7dc5fb9ac" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">What will be the code that perfectly handles the case that Divijoy wants to perform?</p><p data-ref="8e6e6828-0733-419b-9924-edc3467c3504" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="499c4e0b-1352-48c5-91c3-4aa321f4dbcb"></p><p data-ref="53261f0c-6eae-43be-a732-f1f1b1851c5d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cd4cd04a-f95f-420b-8305-f9d585df67a1">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="09cdf1fd-2bb7-47dd-9041-2e2df2e50af9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="9dda4f34-9dc3-4b84-91b4-748e5d96718b">The input line reads a double value.</li></ul><p data-ref="3ab3653e-8643-4c0c-ac56-c47d383ebf61" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="de795d1f-d34d-4af4-908d-2de5cd34e17f"></p><p data-ref="89e5b263-009a-46fc-8295-07b318071b7d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="21ff16e2-222f-4137-9af7-48fa703c5b86">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="e9bec83f-1ae9-45b9-8b9a-419df7c6a366" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="645f349a-bef0-406d-994b-b393a6fb03a7">The output is a double representing the cube root of the given number if the user enters the valid input, Otherwise, it will print <strong data-ref="2ae80abc-7191-4308-ae0a-22bad2d51e74">An error occurred: Invalid input format </strong>if the user enters non-numeric value or it will print <strong data-ref="16cf95dc-c8f6-4243-8946-64410fb3addb">An error occurred: Cannot calculate cube root of a negative number </strong>if the user enters a negative number.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="9a4a8e00-5dc6-4bfa-aa5f-e1a5af5badb6" data-split-to="9a4a8e00-5dc6-4bfa-aa5f-e1a5af5badb6" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="10a86be0-b2cf-48cc-bf9d-3ab6bcabce4e"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="af548e6f-0bea-4d36-9290-cfc84718a8dc" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
