				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-from="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c"><div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-from="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b"><div data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="cb7f1754-261f-467a-8902-29fee605202c" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="cb7f1754-261f-467a-8902-29fee605202c" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="0c0457b4-f8fd-4966-ba57-2d878e1ec789"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="7b017313-613c-4f88-8ece-31c10ed7f63a"><thead data-ref="5e2ed5e7-c560-435d-a174-405bf9dee574"><tr data-ref="5a216f49-b51c-42ab-8bc5-d3bd4b19ed94"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="a3d3ffa4-b4b0-4992-bef1-97156f45a55a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 19</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="1d121317-64be-49e1-a54a-afbd9c68b9d8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="8d5aa281-e5d0-4969-bf8d-b4c176ad7d79"><i data-ref="713bde81-ceea-422b-913f-25bd805a04f7">Weight Limit Validation using Custom Exception</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="d289cadc-862e-44f7-a8db-10d55e113e4b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-29</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="51f845b8-db9c-48f2-b798-bf779ae35769" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="650f4d39-c577-40ec-aefb-d32657647cc0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="926f1872-3b4f-426f-b58e-53c7a31b5825"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="b2bdb530-62e7-467e-a5ae-dae4738b7ba2"><p data-ref="65e1ef9d-d57a-4218-9e8d-3661d09968b8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a program to handle a user-defined exception for weight validation. Create a custom exception class <strong data-ref="c9593fc8-b090-4abb-99eb-ab207e67bb68">InvalidWeight</strong> and use it to check if a given weight input exceeds a specified limit (100 kg). If the weight is valid, display a success message; otherwise, throw and catch the custom exception.</p><p data-ref="3ed47dcc-4112-4ba6-8177-be3aea3a6ab0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="75732730-5552-4eeb-9421-3c0f90c9a5f7"></p><p data-ref="c64aa307-c300-4b97-8ce7-79e45f515872" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="f741a7b4-ff3b-4517-a4a4-84ed97e7d162">Program Requirements:</strong></p><p data-ref="845db61c-dd38-4a9f-a036-b9ee9f30362d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="dd84d6a4-35ad-4c2a-a3f6-15bf2a672b91">1. InvalidWeight</strong> Class (Custom Exception):</p><ul data-ref="0c8eebb5-3dc4-4ffb-804d-1263b7e8a38e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="25102e68-0ded-498d-a9cf-866512a6cf3c">Extend the <strong data-ref="835db67e-fdf1-4c14-8914-7a23078017a2">Exception</strong> class</li><li data-ref="f8b8eb21-007b-459b-9219-21484b9aef4d">Create a parameterized constructor that accepts a String message</li><li data-ref="9c66dee8-4259-4d6e-a931-855cda0b0c0b">Pass the message to the parent <strong data-ref="a8ca5a9d-7f86-4d9c-accf-270d84418483">Exception</strong> class using <strong data-ref="ff9096f5-6e97-427c-9c6c-f3de07d0bdc9">super()</strong></li></ul><p data-ref="56d2f49e-28da-4f6b-91f3-9dd1553cc047" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="9826a068-8524-40e3-8ff3-355c56367754"></p><p data-ref="334859dc-2b81-4249-bb25-ea575f2fab9c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. <strong data-ref="b7bde7ac-e647-43b7-8454-49aec46cf11f">CheckWeight</strong> Class:</p><ul data-ref="6f15e1c6-e46e-4586-af71-bc6bdc960aaf" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="df980d91-9f21-4fde-993e-d341050bf465">Create a method <strong data-ref="b5562dac-0a95-47de-a7d1-de652b056caa">validWeight(int weight)</strong> that throws <strong data-ref="fb2e077e-7b4b-48e5-8be0-b25f51beb762">InvalidWeight</strong></li><li data-ref="aa3b309f-072c-42f2-8002-bf9a6571f669">If weight &gt; 100, throw new <strong data-ref="8529a5e6-8057-490b-8030-ef60670abe66">InvalidWeight</strong> with message: "&lt;weight&gt; is invalid weight\n"</li><li data-ref="cf03c4a9-be9f-4ea1-bddb-353ed9183037">If weight ≤ 100, print: "&lt;weight&gt; is the valid weight\n"</li></ul><p data-ref="06a92337-46c4-4afc-90c8-97a407e4ff35" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b4880a15-7a4a-477f-90ca-e79b88b4ce74"></p><p data-ref="069a4c00-8869-4a9c-a370-c94a900b7845" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="30afc9fd-7b60-4c41-a5f0-20b262c4ba45">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="0e540118-5dcd-497d-b037-6dc0cf1fe24b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="d599b79f-bb26-4a7a-922f-0a001fe187bd">First line: Prompt "Enter weight: " followed by an integer input</li></ul><p data-ref="c7b80e11-7a80-4831-9c9c-fd4d1d68888b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="ac9d987c-b976-4479-8b81-1da86b9e8d42"></p><p data-ref="1120087a-0a43-4171-939a-887a026acd4a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="05658466-b680-4ffd-860e-1c4284e86c34">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="484969d2-5c52-4356-bb22-9cfc2cbd233d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-res