d black;" data-ref="d86af479-0d95-464e-a301-265636d51bb9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="08b614a1-78e6-40e7-93a3-a43863cadc7e"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="6524ed16-5e02-4260-b9c2-f911c6a85497"><p data-ref="b5133b1a-84d8-4ca1-a33c-d2e0b0c0ee6f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program using synchronized threads, which demonstrates producer consumerconcept.</p><p data-ref="b791ebc7-84be-4aa8-8e93-2215a569728c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8db8843f-9600-4110-bdf2-d41e31c5961b"></p><p data-ref="f7bf70e1-3eaf-44f7-b4e2-1d8df7c8a89e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The Producer-Consumer problem is a classic synchronization problem in computer science. It involves two types of threads:</p><ul data-ref="9c68916f-9361-4037-b33c-55a18c1dea3c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="9e349349-c6ec-4b91-a7d7-8376fbcc3fa6"><strong data-ref="84248746-a487-482b-886c-44967431256b">Producer</strong>: This thread generates data (e.g., items) and places it in a shared resource (like a buffer).</li><li data-ref="45792f31-d613-42a9-9c2b-c4614fc7862f"><strong data-ref="cff1c568-d8a1-4fb1-a31e-0b6a893ad083">Consumer</strong>: This thread takes data (items) from the shared resource for processing or consumption.</li></ul><p data-ref="5835ed8f-0be8-4326-9c94-44f825d562eb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5d2b07e6-75b1-4fc2-8458-4c051d4ecfb9"></p><p data-ref="5bdfb488-7302-468e-8f6d-fd572b0ff7f0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The problem revolves around coordinating these threads such that:</p><ul data-ref="6792f48f-0968-44cd-84c4-8be92e3a966c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="e3b4f2bb-18e6-4208-8835-a8c40dede65a">The producer does not produce when the buffer is full.</li><li data-ref="6d198c2d-050a-448d-a60f-83a02c6bf522">The consumer does not consume when the buffer is empty.</li><li data-ref="419f0422-6171-48ae-9dee-2c421aa74195">Both threads operate safely without corrupting the shared resource.</li></ul><p data-ref="3d6f2a90-9a90-4fc7-bda2-7f2383b1c96d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="2ce81302-f0fe-4527-b5d0-43a0c3eda9eb"></p><p data-ref="bf73091f-636b-4800-a86f-70d995625b48" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">To achieve synchronization in Java, we can use the synchronized keyword along with wait and notify methods to control the interaction between the threads.</p><p data-ref="ba43500a-bf54-4d48-ad92-fe426d8a375d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7a34f69d-226d-4801-8870-5a8706151d8a"></p><p data-ref="7e6e2414-a5f4-4a37-9963-099c834455c7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="7f4dc338-8380-4aa4-9e23-d345de0b012d">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="634c67de-9ab0-4fbc-bbf6-d4be0a5fb0c3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="725cf9cf-1d81-48ca-aff3-0a90e75a0bdd">Prompt the user to enter an integer representing the number of items to produce along with a print statement <strong data-ref="bac06b08-71e4-481c-9311-bdeeb5acb5ad">"Enter the number of items to produce: " </strong></li></ul><p data-ref="07483e28-cc2b-4a2e-b658-193b6a2dc7fe" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8eaae4b6-76b7-4585-b0b6-75762274821a"></p><p data-ref="719cbf8f-0969-4cab-97d5-7c485bcdf356" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d7fe0ac2-7e38-4e67-b67a-89ed800e351d">Output Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="3aea645a-41bf-40e8-926c-d73071ed0ff5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Output should print the following:</p><ul data-ref="63167d18-30d2-4d18-9b24-28bb842f5ba2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="fbc5a50f-cdad-4870-9628-630f38951840">Messages indicating the production of each item as &lt;Produced: {Produced item}&gt;</li><li data-ref="d3971bfb-7066-4383-a7a0-0db314ea413f">Messages indicating the consumption of each item as &lt;Consumed: {Consumed item}&gt;</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="46dcb73f-fc7d-48ca-9ca0-28545715466f" data-split-to="46dcb73f-fc7d-48ca-9ca0-28545715466f" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="26574e11-3824-4116-b671-c748bec3224a"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="5fa3b52f-a668-440f-85ef-9bb88b9d17b9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
