				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-from="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c"><div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-from="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b"><div data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="fc2426a4-92c7-4403-b904-bf21b93052be" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="fc2426a4-92c7-4403-b904-bf21b93052be" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="90d1e261-92ff-4bea-9f4c-69422b93cb29"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="0422318c-2eec-4e3e-8529-061c2675640c"><thead data-ref="8de3cd49-6d71-4345-b2f7-8fbf21c3526b"><tr data-ref="68bf248d-8a98-474e-945f-478bed4e8791"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="6a1211af-8d99-4b3c-bc97-1dc66fad6806" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 21</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="263fcaa9-7432-47ed-9adc-e24365b66347" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="b1f3f594-e296-4670-ba07-f30564addaf4"><i data-ref="412a7c27-ecf3-40b6-be43-e0453260b57e">Multithreaded Java Program</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="fca0a5cd-8ab7-4d17-abba-7fcdc8f20cbf" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-31</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="bbf4e8f9-02ea-4454-83ea-105ea48e7d34" data-undisplayed="undisplayed" data-split-to="bbf4e8f9-02ea-4454-83ea-105ea48e7d34" data-split-original="true"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="d9a7aee9-b270-44e2-bfc5-07c294a69de6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="f31e0537-d388-4e81-9108-32635687c1c7"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="f9a8fab9-946c-469c-bac2-f8962336b3f0" data-split-to="f9a8fab9-946c-469c-bac2-f8962336b3f0" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><p data-ref="6ffe7452-d2be-4637-a75b-d749186b6b10" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Implement a multithreaded Java program where three threads, with a specified number of times as input by the user, execute concurrently with a fixed sleep time before each message print.</p><p data-ref="ef9f7e34-ac4c-46aa-a72e-b46ca908ff86" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c0619496-ea3f-41d5-8f32-408e1ab7a65c"></p><p data-ref="f1316ec5-d68a-440f-9925-0d7482d61a38" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="4e99ccd0-8269-4b1f-ad7a-e94b3110b9fb">Requirements:</strong></p><p data-ref="fa818616-fbf7-49f8-a3a9-979967480b1a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cea3b9b2-1141-4f5a-ab93-009df21b3713">1. Define the GoodMorning thread class</strong></p><p data-ref="6f2d57a1-577a-44c9-b212-054c118f3c3e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Create a class named <strong data-ref="bc035b3a-4eba-47a7-a1b3-9c66b01c025e">GoodMorning</strong> that extends <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="91b3cbaa-0a2b-47f7-a8c8-da037f7d7245">Thread</span>.</p><p data-ref="24f727d3-8171-4960-9c3c-5f758363c4f1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Accept the number of repetitions as a parameter through the constructor.</p><p data-ref="ced52fd8-dc90-4162-92f0-8e189b917054" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. Override the <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="4516c8c9-27f1-4e81-af63-127596bd65bd">run()</span> method to:</p><ul data-ref="075e0a3b-6938-4f7f-b293-60ea46d5f0de" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="8166d10e-da9e-42e4-a616-7c95802dac99">Pause execution for 0.2 seconds using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="3a094f04-12bf-4139-a315-6b5261e2909e">Thread.sleep()</span>.</li><li data-ref="2cdaa3af-dc37-458b-903e-eaac0820ebc9">Print "Good morning" for the given number of repetitions.</li></ul><p data-ref="fa820ed1-b3e8-4c45-8312-9ea9f7191657" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="66885908-a03c-4575-b8a0-8681558215cf">2. Define the Hello thread class</strong></p><p data-ref="f47c04d5-23f8-4802-a035-96a516644521" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Create a class named <strong data-ref="084a590b-069c-4177-bd24-0570536ff58d">Hello</strong> that extends <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="fa5cb7b6-9e34-49ee-a5c8-086e7a852b05">Thread</span>.</p><p data-ref="9672b9d4-0aa1-459d-a1a5-64f91792007d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Accept the number of repetitions as a parameter through the constructor.</p><p data-ref="fb40d028-f9c2-4d67-a4e7-58e0877a09d3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. Override the <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="2c949f27-4517-49d8-9e23-8c924645ed0d">run()</span> method to:</p><ul data-ref="d1e52f15-85aa-4d71-abc9-9254619b43b7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="f7a5d9fe-5c49-4246-a123-8cfc2064ffb0">Pause execution for 0.3 seconds using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="8071979e-e46e-476f-8f0f-602e21ecf1c7">Thread.sleep()</span>.</li><li data-ref="1d051e81-1c07-4864-a5a8-c16859cc78a4">Print "Hello" after each sleep.</li><li data-ref="9f0d0b1c-f39d-4ca9-89ae-7cd5d292ec76">Repeat for the given number of times.</li></ul><p data-ref="ba45e47a-dd85-42d7-b4bf-97a5a19c3bc6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="1044c8b9-1d3d-40f8-a729-32a725aff044">3. Define the Welcome thread class</strong></p><p data-ref="d2aa7c0d-2c2b-49f5-a3b6-064729a164e1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Create a class named <strong data-ref="a0524394-d1b0-4a55-9f6a-30801c1a18e7">Welcome</strong> that extends <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="e47846c1-ac3d-4108-ae62-712bbee5df16">Thread</span>.</p><p data-ref="c188d8ab-be0b-4ad4-b57d-34383abfd7be" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Accept the number of repetitions as a parameter through the constructor.</p><p data-ref="f8bbfeb2-4066-42d1-90d1-f082ecff9319" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. Override the <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="4a6c2011-9f4b-4270-b6b6-5e26c7f80b4f">run()</span> method to:</p><ul data-ref="20160e5b-c1e9-4abd-8fdf-f426cecd3aa8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="11629103-6360-49d5-a1ad-a5940cc3b4ed">Pause execution for 0.4 seconds using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="8ffdc048-72f1-4fb4-b7b5-86f0efd0b17e">Thread.sleep()</span>.</li><li data-ref="5f81d125-f870-43b9-9202-b75139a18542">Print "Welcome" after each sleep.</li><li data-ref="d8b83d88-34a9-403a-aa03-59003650012c">Repeat for the given number of times.</li></ul><p data-ref="f071ebb1-1b12-4ac7-b1de-c20d4bcb2941" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="bfec7d7c-8441-4db7-8f14-395f19a7fb40">4.</strong> Implement the<strong data-ref="11a6ec76-3a9e-40d7-8540-40aeff29f9e2"> MultithreadDemo</strong> class</p><p data-ref="85b72e85-9fe5-466d-8b15-7bcd25ad3ff6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Use a <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="10752cd5-6070-4bc4-9ebd-8fbf6dc3648f">Scanner</span> object to accept three integers from the user:</p><ul data-ref="6a1b79bf-9d57-4fef-a025-49b3eed39d2e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c662612f-17b1-49bd-96c8-9139938811c9">Number of times "Good morning" should be printed.</li><li data-ref="6ed3b7a5-22fa-44e6-8eb2-00449f39fef7">Number of times "Hello" should be printed.</li><li data-ref="afd2ecfa-8628-4e5b-be04-fc453805f630">Number of times "Welcome" should be printed.</li></ul><p data-ref="e14dba57-8f97-4213-80e8-e52e70c054e9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Create objects of <strong data-ref="29e3b637-0e3f-4f78-ac98-723a47b5a58d">GoodMorning</strong>, <strong data-ref="0866134f-b8a6-4c7e-8943-a61317defe01">Hello</strong>, and <strong data-ref="ef989861-e84c-4c39-a7d7-9b04d7e35af4">Welcome</strong> classes using the user inputs.</p><p data-ref="4a72ee6b-db2c-4309-9f68-c2cff4939bc5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. Start all three threads using the <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="38680f8f-c919-418b-91b9-bd595a9a4dcb">start()</span> method.</p><p data-ref="cef236c6-abda-41eb-a6a1-4ecd9f6c2f51" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0ea86203-7140-4edb-91c7-78b36ba4b85b"></p><p data-ref="16c8580a-aa11-4d34-ae97-76bf24577150" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="022ccb3e-c6fb-4eb2-8d76-d148e0cd58c0">Input Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="85ba201f-ce06-4e04-9618-0e99e75155c7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Three integers entered by the user (each on a separate line):</p><ul data-ref="8d920d87-3667-4c66-8a8c-642a6f79b88d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="272f2663-9232-4fce-8417-f89a477d58ea">Repetitions for "Good morning".</li><li data-ref="5fcad2f8-359e-4ca3-8f2a-7248fc291c79">Repetitions for "Hello".</li><li data-ref="753f131e-ef26-4e2f-ae15-9124caecb1b5">Repetitions for "Welcome".</li></ul><p data-ref="5d204187-980a-476c-8b07-1d05529afa45" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e35df4c4-7ad7-49e2-a101-678b773df103"></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
