			<div class="pagedjs_area">
				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-from="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c" data-split-to="7cb5fa85-9758-4dfe-86f0-f120aeeba20c"><div class="page" data-ref="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-from="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b" data-split-to="938e076f-4f34-4357-b5da-5bd23e258d8b"><div data-ref="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1" data-split-to="dc59c255-4c05-4f74-867c-caf558f627f1"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="bea2a7f5-d3de-463a-afc0-ecacf3fbd380" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="bea2a7f5-d3de-463a-afc0-ecacf3fbd380" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="2400e135-768b-439e-af23-350ea7073684"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="71889b23-3a60-4981-ac30-6cf87f9769d7"><thead data-ref="7238a434-3218-4bb4-bd1a-096a7bee7f4f"><tr data-ref="4db249f5-830e-460b-bba0-da0ca9cb7169"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="f1529545-5308-4716-b4bd-0e184bf2ae80" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 23</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="d189bd61-c030-40aa-bed2-b736e9a78a27" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="dcc35ed1-2445-445c-ade3-15cdc7b79dd2"><i data-ref="3c0b6242-7c0c-4a95-ad77-8d3bc405ed9d">Daemon Threads</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="15d5570a-0a89-4f10-8ba0-8b732ab60429" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-31</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="0f537b49-d4a1-47d5-b800-0cc1b7ba00e8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="ce0a7e51-7665-40a4-b88b-79b1142602a2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="8d0cffc0-e76d-4adf-8f10-61ff95db45ff"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="d30f5023-34f1-4a7b-863c-9012f85552cb"><p data-ref="d2bb825b-308a-4a99-941f-9b9b1fb11e98" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Create a Java program that demonstrates the use of user and daemon threads. Implement a class <strong data-ref="3ecede7c-da03-40de-9621-daa5539d718c">WorkerThread</strong> that extends <strong data-ref="eb89d4af-15f2-4a72-a3af-f5f94dcc072a">Thread</strong> and overrides the <strong data-ref="5c8aa178-71ca-4970-846e-8da8f09d75f7">run</strong> method to simulate some work by printing messages and sleeping for a short duration.</p><p data-ref="b8861607-38e4-4d52-bbc9-e26dd78c00a6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d6d3de86-9fbc-4b72-a310-2ff8f758f786"></p><p data-ref="a10f6988-bd62-4740-b76f-523706bddc01" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">In the <strong data-ref="b247494e-3cc8-4ae3-9cb7-499bcecec1e3">DaemonThread</strong> class:</p><p data-ref="c98556a7-5e97-422a-9587-95adced956e9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">1. Prompt the user to input the number of user threads and daemon threads.</p><p data-ref="8113d7d8-9d18-4b81-8a81-69a8babd324b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">2. Create and start the specified number of user threads and daemon threads.</p><ul data-ref="c5d28686-b621-4bb5-a348-52ecd479912c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="03627ea7-e492-4c4f-af2a-08ea238c3318"><strong data-ref="e880b838-79dc-49fb-a983-e1afce5af47b">User Threads: </strong>These threads will run to completion and are not interrupted by the main thread.<strong data-ref="21b44828-1d01-498e-9506-b7e74faea763">Daemon Threads:</strong> These threads will run in the background and may be terminated abruptly when the main thread exits.</li></ul><p data-ref="5f809ba2-859b-4ab8-807e-54d59a7c2058" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">3. The main thread should print a message indicating its exit after creating the threads.</p><p data-ref="ff118de7-bd0c-4633-8ede-a44092b99a84" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7b43e8ba-6046-4d3f-b31c-3edb56621311"></p><p data-ref="419bdeae-f7a5-48e8-86ad-92ed8cec92f0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="16165ccc-f3c3-4fab-b132-fa8bf4a361ea">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="73de655e-a298-4a9d-90af-bbbeaafa2617" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="388a5613-3a19-4e5b-a9d7-f15466af3bb7">The first line contains an integer specifying the number of user threads.</li><li data-ref="c9ed802b-c3e8-44c3-90d7-d6024574b1bd">The second line contains an integer specifying the number of daemon threads.</li></ul><p data-ref="b89a3465-941c-4f24-8132-039f9afb86bc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7a516b90-ea97-4ce4-956c-21df2f2442ab"></p><p data-ref="8042971c-7aa7-4347-a7d1-6b99937ef5fb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="79427963-e1d3-4d35-a5ff-96932907cba1">Output Format:</strong></p><p data-ref="1eb85154-583e-41a2-aeec-1a86efb876f2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">The output should display the following:</p><ul data-ref="3bc1b4a7-e2fe-4b4f-addc-29c632edb6a1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="66f93b86-5426-4c8b-915d-d7e57a69b866">Messages indicating the <strong data-ref="2f778bf6-0aaa-4c07-8589-aa36261356a4">start</strong> and <strong data-ref="5dd4e4a6-9afe-4be0-9e4d-bc11f3931249">finish</strong> of each user thread.</li><li data-ref="f4e23deb-34ab-478f-8458-be5828f4372d">Messages indicating the <strong data-ref="16fb5359-d6f0-4da0-9705-7608ea0d619e">start</strong> and <strong data-ref="4d20db7f-f4d8-40f0-84a7-c45b513dc631">finish</strong> of each daemon thread.</li><li data-ref="a410a741-5c68-4807-9974-40c792193d4e">A message indicating that the main thread is exiting as: "Main thread exiting".</li></ul><p data-ref="87fb1872-3968-4996-ac39-59ce80d1d4c9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="710e002e-1b69-42e8-b2f6-a7704d45d1cd"></p><p data-ref="da8fa678-9d88-47f1-ab3d-d2ba79a31266" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="82608a56-4c7b-4fac-933c-b271b052fbab">Note:</strong></p><ul data-ref="37796de9-ede4-452a-9974-554df90af759" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="257e7d02-c522-43b7-a405-077be0ed0981">Ensure that daemon threads are correctly set using <strong data-ref="438e7e34-06c5-456c-9915-b3ebdc2f5ff5">setDaemon(true) </strong>before calling <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="a313d3a6-bd7e-4712-9b52-865daa49c8b2">start()</span><strong data-ref="26cba0f4-39ba-439e-bae9-513f537e0fb5">.</strong></li><li data-ref="d0f4a763-d6bd-4869-a0fa-8621860501da">Refer to visible test cases for better understanding and to match with input/output layout.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="a7b64804-c850-47a9-b3bb-e6dcc64aae7c" data-split-to="a7b64804-c850-47a9-b3bb-e6dcc64aae7c" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="f0f1396b-2461-48b9-a394-0e2938daacd9"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="75175e8a-335e-4339-8e09-89fb84cc373f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
