der-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="a6fa45d9-4b3b-429d-b1a8-ea7f1a1f2bc9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="fa21ae64-4bd7-4250-a010-28a9019f42ba"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="4ea1ecd8-01b3-4b19-8d7f-59d97b6675e3"><p data-ref="56b8a06f-4f96-4dc1-804f-d1c7d41df74c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a Java program that creates two threads, <strong data-ref="b90712a1-a532-4d54-9f40-3a3a0afbc6ba">FirstThread</strong> and <strong data-ref="f6aefd2c-5553-4474-8295-814fc46616db">SecondThread</strong>, to print messages a specified number of times with a 100 ms delay.</p><ul data-ref="dd851307-4b36-409c-8173-c09c635ce2a0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="7617ed39-4e8c-4aa7-b1a1-cd5a195ee6a5">The program should prompt the user to enter the number of messages for the First Thread and the Second Thread.</li><li data-ref="4cc4397d-3e72-43a1-934b-03df391c7c97"><strong data-ref="07d9b34f-d782-4329-9f4c-2d5ac0edacb7">FirstThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from First Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="72cb25c1-ce4a-4c16-a150-8713a24468f2"><strong data-ref="fe1e1298-48f0-4c93-9416-2938c33f65b9">SecondThread</strong> should print messages as “Message from Second Thread: &lt;i&gt;” where &lt;i&gt; is the current iteration.</li><li data-ref="b76c7cd7-a461-4e15-922b-3c2c9439a6cb">The main thread should:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="cd3e67e3-4dab-41e5-b572-7135a4891dab">Start both threads using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="70acd3b3-32aa-4e2e-8778-5cb3bcf5638d">start()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="7d697d91-252b-479d-aad9-93b82a54c449">Display their alive status using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="fa02b839-3440-48cb-a152-c59bdb9033e5">isAlive()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="15dbd807-5a47-4557-a5e2-0372dcc561ec">Wait for each thread to finish using <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="06e22094-a9e4-454a-b03d-72869051fe40">join()</span>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="91466909-6fb2-4d3c-b1fe-e502fe382c4d">Display messages while waiting and after completion.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="500231ce-2f97-46d2-822e-89fab2bde82f">Verify and display the alive status of threads after they complete.</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="fdc7d19f-45fe-463a-8a42-1aa8b20b7397">Print a final message indicating the main thread has finished.</li><li data-ref="45c603bd-01bc-42e7-828b-1bea04656aeb">Both threads should properly handle <span class="ql-font-monospace" data-ref="83aa3488-013e-45c3-af68-d30af8ec4a44">InterruptedException</span> during sleep.</li></ul><p data-ref="ff1e3fe7-b7f5-47d1-90bc-320ad365c0ce" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="a0b56a7e-093b-4324-8c36-c974cd363106"></p><p data-ref="647313fb-5f4d-4cd1-98da-461bce2ac2e6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="585500ac-00cd-43f4-80b5-655d76d636bb">﻿Input Format:</strong></p><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="911ebb54-ebaa-4f3f-bf12-34ed376b1382" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Enter the count for First Thread: [user-input-integer]
Enter the count for Second Thread: [user-input-integer]
</pre><p data-ref="31a5ef0a-f669-47c8-a61e-b3809630a1ba" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8395936e-f4be-4747-94c2-0bafaf851ffd"></p><p data-ref="e6303481-8651-4611-870d-468ae2e95e88" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="96f94984-7e6c-4f1c-ae9b-6b12c4d241e6">﻿Output Format:</strong></p><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false" data-ref="cc017e9d-16a5-4b1c-8495-318361bf9558" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">FirstThread is alive: true
