</pre><p data-ref="6b775b61-b29b-4a8f-96e8-3ef69a1d192f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="dda0c3f9-f667-4f39-94d1-1fc47fc397d5"></p><p data-ref="e874b8b4-2709-44c9-bf46-478770c8a977" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="68d180d2-28da-4b75-aeb6-69cf33046712">Note:</strong></p><ul data-ref="73c11059-398e-4804-bdbf-c33c1e38969e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="466968ee-1943-4f9d-883d-ec2432e20b18">The print statements for the output are already present in the editor. Your task is to implement the logic in the specified sections of the code.</li><li data-ref="9cfb3994-c2c6-4488-a0cd-e228af2e6584">Refer to the visible test cases to strictly match the input/output layout.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="05ab6236-6c6f-4d8c-9d80-33cc4ee38f9b" data-split-to="05ab6236-6c6f-4d8c-9d80-33cc4ee38f9b" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="0ea9a069-4324-45aa-b6e5-81dfd22c876a"><b style="bo