om:1px solid black;" data-ref="7f2cf9ab-2d23-44b9-b9ee-f22274bf1d60" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="22ed8212-d010-485d-a092-441ee87f520b"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="c6f88069-b388-40c7-b627-2722d3d4d6a2"><p data-ref="97637ed4-516a-4323-be62-3b3f4eaf8d97" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a java program to create a user-defined package called “<strong data-ref="142e72be-520e-4361-951e-fe3617ae7d26">data</strong>” and perform <strong data-ref="b3b95d3a-c479-47dd-af39-39c158f11279">Arithmetic operations </strong>(addition, subtraction, multiplication, divison) using packages.</p><p data-ref="1a94e8da-3651-4d5f-b33b-4f2ca9d2fcce" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="2c6d53bc-f67f-45c1-a904-b81322f35457"></p><p data-ref="ae8c1fc8-ab27-4cf8-977e-0b3077121f9a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cca43df0-ae61-4f81-b004-6462801f5f19">Note: </strong>Write the required operations in the data/Arithmetic.java file.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="17882d4f-a37b-4c27-92a2-9d5671c2adfe" data-split-to="17882d4f-a37b-4c27-92a2-9d5671c2adfe" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="f1b0706a-7f1d-4a47-8217-426a81bb9604"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="86a1a712-8c47-41ee-acbd-a3bf7363f52b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="1995a3d6-535f-46f4-81dc-6b5b06c3ff0e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="f5c81013-3490-4e02-9cba-baf1b1e8bf0d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">data/Arithmetic.java</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="0ea0ceb4-dacf-4e04-866f-1dda133cb151" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">package data;

public class Arithmetic {

    public static int add(int a, int b) {
        return a + b;
    }

    public static int subtract(int a, int b) {
        return a - b;
    }

    public static int multiply(int a, int b) {
        return a * b;
    }

    public static double divide(int a, int b) {
        return (double) a / b;
    }
}</pre><br data-ref="fa209838-0102-4bbd-b65c-9a462c3a0e4a"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
